  "ruleText": "Env-A 104.53 “Responsible official” means “responsible official” as defined in 40 CFR 70.2, reprinted in Appendix D.\n\nSource. #6057-A, eff 6-30-95; ss and renumbered by #8256, eff 1-14-05 (from Env-A 101.235), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.164), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.166) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
